Pebbles","stars":4,"forks":4,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"9-Pebbles :   Description : This is very simple game played by 2 players. You can play offline 2 players or play with Computer.  Initially 9 pebbles are given to both player. Aim is to create a Straight Line either Horizontally or Vertically. When a Straight line is created, you claim a pebble from Opposition that must not belongs to a Straight line.  When all pebbles are placed on desk, single movements starts. You will get 4 options \"Left\"/\"Right\"/\"Top\"/\"Bottom\" to move your pebble to create a Straight line.  When you claim all pebbles from opposition then you will win the game.  I added \"Online\" feature for simple conversation with online users. But for that, you have to login with your google account. Enjoy :-)","topics":["authentication","firebase","game"],"score":284211,"global_rank":30907},{"name":"stevejenkins/hardwarefreak.com-fqrdns.pcre","owner":"stevejenkins","html_url":"https://github.com/stevejenkins/hardwarefreak.com-fqrdns.pcre","stars":26,"forks":9,"watchers":16,"issues":2,"language":"Other","description":"Archive copy of Stan Hoeppner's Postfix PCRE bot spam killer (fqrdns.pcre)","topics":["bot-spam","dnsbl","dnsbl-rejections","pcre","postfix","postscreen","regular-expression"],"score":284194,"global_rank":30916},{"name":"justyeethan/AnyaVim","owner":"justyeethan","html_url":"https://github.com/justyeethan/AnyaVim","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Lua","description":"Lazyvim config but Anya based. Very waku waku.","topics":[],"score":284191,"global_rank":30919},{"name":"shanemhansen/gogeo","owner":"shanemhansen","html_url":"https://github.com/shanemhansen/gogeo","stars":8,"forks":2,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"Go bindings to the GeoIP database","topics":[],"score":284185,"global_rank":30920},{"name":"ScottDuckworth/mtpt","owner":"ScottDuckworth","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottDuckworth/mtpt","stars":